  "description": "Redis adapters for WebReaper: the Redis scheduler, visited-link tracker, sink, and Redis-backed scraper-config and cookie storage, all sharing one connection pool (ADR-0005). Adds ScraperEngineBuilder.WithRedisScheduler / TrackVisitedLinksInRedis / WriteToRedis / WithRedisConfigStorage / WithRedisCookieStorage. Satellite package (ADR-0009) so the WebReaper core stays dependency-light and AOT-clean.",
